{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Set a price cap for Private Dental work",
        "additional_details": "Many of the British public are forced to seek treatment from the Private Dental sector due to the lack of availability of NHS Dentists, of which we have all paid our taxes for. In our view, the Government has by stealth made dental care unaffordable to a large proportion of the British public, and therefore we think that the Government should take responsibility for introducing a price cap on Private Dental Fees.",
        "background": "A root canal on the NHS is \u00a376.60, however the same treatment at a private dentist can be \u00a31000, or even \u00a31560. We therefore call on the government to introduce price capping on private dental work to stop what we think is obvious profiteering.",
